{"ref":"BDB, עַזְמָ֫וֶת","hw":"עַזְמָ֫וֶת","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַזְמָ֫וֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> A 𝔊L usually Αζμωθ, Ασμωθ:<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  one of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.31\">2 S 23:31</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.33\">1 Ch 11:33</a>, B Ασβωθ. <strong>b.</strong>  father of two of David’s men <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.3\">1 Ch 12:3</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  officer of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.25\">1 Ch 27:25</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  Benjamite name <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.36\">1 Ch 8:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.42\">9:42</a>, B Σαλμω, Γαβαωθ.","next":"BDB, עַזְמָ֫וֶת²","prev":"BDB, עַזְגָּד"}